#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/create_summary.rst:5
msgid "Create summary"
msgstr "创建摘要"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/create_summary.rst:7
msgid ""
"A `project`_ can be a group of `folios`_, QElectroTech provides the "
"possibility to make a summary, project index, which shows the information "
"from the different `folios`_. QElectroTech allows creating the project "
"summary automatically."
msgstr ""
"A`项目 <project_>`_ 可以是一组 `图幅 <folios_>`_，QElectroTech提供了制作一个摘要的可能性，项目索引，显示不同 "
"`图幅 <folios_>`_ 的信息。QEctroTech允许自动创建项目摘要。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/create_summary.rst:13
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech list of folios"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 光圈列表"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/create_summary.rst:15
msgid "To create a project summary:"
msgstr "要创建项目摘要："

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/create_summary.rst:17
msgid ""
"Activate the folio where the summary table has to be created in the "
"`workspace`_."
msgstr "激活 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中必须创建总表的框。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/create_summary.rst:18
msgid ""
"Select **Project > Add a summary** to display the configuration PopUp window"
" of the summary creator."
msgstr "选择 **项目 > 添加摘要** 以显示摘要创建者的配置弹出窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/create_summary.rst:23
#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/create_summary.rst:33
#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/create_summary.rst:55
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech project menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 项目菜单"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/create_summary.rst:26
msgid "Go to **Display** tab to define display table properties."
msgstr "转到 **Display** 标签，以定义显示表属性 。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/create_summary.rst:27
msgid "Define the **Table name** which will identify the table."
msgstr "定义将标明表格的 **表名称**。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/create_summary.rst:28
msgid ""
"Configure the display table settings (header and table cells properties, "
"auto adjustment of table size, etc.)."
msgstr "配置显示表设置(标题和表格单元格属性，表格大小的自动调整等)."

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/create_summary.rst:36
msgid "Go to **Content** tab to define table columns."
msgstr "转到 **Content** 标签来定义表格列 。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/create_summary.rst:37
msgid "Modify the table content using the following commands:"
msgstr "使用下列命令修改表格内容："

