#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/create_summary.rst:60
msgid ""
"The content request configuration can be saved and chosen from "
"**Configuration** section to increase working efficiency."
msgstr "内容请求配置可以从 **配置** 部分保存和选择，以提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/create_summary.rst:62
msgid ""
"QElectroTech is working with SQLite database, summary table content can also"
" be defined by SQL query."
msgstr "QElectroTech正与SQLite数据库合作，总表内容也可以通过SQL查询来定义。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/create_summary.rst:64
msgid ""
"Once the desired configuration is defined, press **OK** to create summary "
"tables."
msgstr "一旦定义了想要的配置，按 **OK** 创建汇总表。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/create_summary.rst:68
msgid "The project summary can be created, modified and updated at any time."
msgstr "项目概要可以随时创建，修改和更新。"
